WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.768
[music playing]

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.870
HAZEN AUDEL: The Mani have
an unrivaled knowledge

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:08.174
of the local plants and trees,
relying on them for almost

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.309
everything they need.

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.014
[non-english speech]

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:15.849
Huh?

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.150
[non-english speech]

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:20.153
[non-english speech]
That one right there.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.087
[non-english speech]

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.088
Oh.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.224
It's basically like a palm tree.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:28.395
And it is spiky and
thorny everywhere on it.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:35.135
[non-english speech] Up there?

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.503
[non-english speech]

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.438
You just climb this to
get all the way up there.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.143
Look at that.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:49.983
The Mani are expert climbers.

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:52.819
Training begins at a young age.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.889
By adulthood, they're
able to scale the tallest

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.191
trees in the forest.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:00.360
Now, that man can climb a tree.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:03.296
It makes perfect sense
because in a forest like this,

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.432
it's a whole 'nother
world out there.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:08.902
And to the Mani, half their
meat market and grocery store

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.837
is up in those branches.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:14.974
He's doing this
all methodically.

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:16.743
All this comes with
a lot of practice.

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:24.317
OK, yeah, this is the stuff.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:29.789
It's like this really felty
material, really fibrousy.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.791
It's the stuff that
grows between the really

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:35.195
spiky outer bark in the
inner cambium up there.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.330
[music playing]

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:42.702
Nice.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:44.137
[laughs]

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:48.708
This plant fiber makes
excellent tinder,

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.710
but we've collected it
for a different purpose.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.716
[non-english speech]

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:57.951
Take one of these?

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.353
[non-english speech]

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.054
OK.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.822
These are target darts.

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:03.723
[non-english speech]

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.625
No poison on the end.

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:06.759
Oh, OK.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.761
Take this.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:15.468
So this little wadding,
shove that right in there.

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:20.907
And then that totally
completes the air seal.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.275
Huh?

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:25.912
Making the tube airtight
allows us to fire the darts

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.480
using the power of our lungs.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:35.388
[inaudible] has been hunting
with blow guns since he was 15.

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:39.759
These powerful precision weapons
rely on an expert combination

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:43.062
of steady aim and timing.

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.230
Bullseye.

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:47.433
That is just straight
and powerful.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.970
Blow guns are handmade in the
village using a special bamboo

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:53.640
called [inaudible].

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:57.277
Two tubes are carefully heated
and massaged over hot coals,

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.913
and are made to be as
straight as possible.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:04.717
They are then glued together
using a sticky tree resin.

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:08.621
This extra length provides
deadly force and accuracy.

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:09.622
Launching?

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:14.027
Darts at several
hundred miles per hour.

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:15.194
Look at that.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:17.130
Just to see how
powerful, this dart went

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:19.933
all the way through the target.

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:22.702
Now, it's my turn.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:25.171
It's a good thing these things
are light, because there's

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:26.506
a lot of leverage on the end.

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:28.775
But then, your hands
don't get in the way

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:31.077
of siting the blowgun.

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:31.878
I got this.

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:37.350
[groans]

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:39.686
Yeah, I didn't
make it that time.

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:40.787
[inaudible]

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:41.955
It'll take some practice.

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.456
It went way into the jungle.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.529
During a hunt, you rarely
get a second chance.

00:03:52.198 --> 00:03:54.701
I need to demonstrate this
is a skill I can master.

00:03:58.071 --> 00:03:59.439
OK, so how do you
hold your hands?

00:03:59.505 --> 00:04:05.745
Just put that on the bottom.

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:07.447
Oh, wow, OK.

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.849
So you lock your two
index fingers up on top.

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:18.257
There we go!

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:21.260
Yeah, bullseye, bullseye.

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:24.497
Nice, nice, getting
more practice.

00:04:24.564 --> 00:04:31.137
They fire so fast and accurate,
they really jam in there.

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:34.440
MANI PERSON:
[non-english speech]

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:35.375
Huh?

00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:36.342
MANI PERSON:
[non-english speech]

00:04:36.409 --> 00:04:37.577
Yeah, [non-english speech].

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:39.912
Good deal, good deal.
yeah, yeah, nice.

00:04:39.979 --> 00:04:41.881
Starting to get
the hang of this.

